  "html": "<article data-article-id=\"e6b6901e-f210-454c-a424-0ca92eb725ce\">\n  <figure>\n    <img src=\"/images/articles/e6b6901e-f210-454c-a424-0ca92eb725ce-1.jpg\" alt=\"A wooden cross beside snow-covered rocks under a blue sky.\">\n  </figure>\n  <p class=\"poem\"><strong><em>It is a self-abandonment,<br>\n  a wandering out of ourselves.<br>\n  It is a voluntary death, wherein<br>\n  the lover dies to himself and all his own interests,<br>\n  not thinking of them or caring for them any more.<br>\n  He minds nothing, but how he may please<br>\n  and bless the one whom he loves.</em></strong></p>\n  <p class=\"poem\"><strong><em>Be it God,<br>\n  be it a person,<br>\n  be it a family,<br>\n  or be it a people.</em></strong></p>\n</article>\n",
